{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their childhoods ended the day the sky fell. Earth\u2019s destined defenders are nothing more than four children\u2014feared for the power that threatens to consume them. Wage war against the vibrant lies of a modern-day apocalypse: world-shaking disasters, unknowable cosmic entities, and prophecies unraveling toward the End.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Unconventional Combat Styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a band of heroes whose strategies break the mold. From Clancy, the uncontrollable berserker, to Nixie, the item-hoarding kleptomaniac, each ally brings their own unique quirks, guaranteed to shake up combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transformations Galore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their powers grow, enemies and allies alike undergo astonishing transformations. Watch your party evolve in fantastic new ways throughout the adventure and prepare for surprising mid-journey mishaps and sudden shape-shifting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Entities Shaping the Apocalypse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret war rages in the cosmos. Peer behind the veil and step into the Apocalypse. Meet its victims, its instigators, and uncover the dark forces who are bringing about the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/extras/8d57252a7ab184065023c4403c5bea41.poster.avif?t=1749686452\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/extras/8d57252a7ab184065023c4403c5bea41.apng?t=1749686452\" class=\"bb_img\" width=108 height=128 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603430?t=1749686452","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/2437eda821668a93d54279757c965a7546d2c361/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749686452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/c5d57f3258f6afaa261ba2ed41cf2c6128c158bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749686452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/c5d57f3258f6afaa261ba2ed41cf2c6128c158bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749686452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3688760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Meet the Party</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/extras/0b56953afc1f5ca9fe25b90b4377c680.avif?t=1749686452\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLANCY -\u00a0</strong>The smug, hot-blooded leader of the apocalypse task force, whose unchecked fury can cause him to lose control in the heat of battle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/extras/7666ff7aca51cf78e0dcd5582ddcc200.avif?t=1749686452\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NESBIT -\u00a0</strong>A bumbling worrywart with a deep curiosity for the natural world. He was forced into solitude by a deadly plague and now... he's buzzing with a perplexing power.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/extras/7be9fc609ab2b8fe228dc11b60b68ce9.avif?t=1749686452\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WERM -</strong>\u00a0A lighthearted young boy who mysteriously appeared in the plague-ridden city. He has become the party\u2019s guide, leading them to the heart of the infection.</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their childhoods ended the day the sky fell. Earth\u2019s destined defenders are nothing more than four children\u2014feared for the power that threatens to consume them. Wage war against the vibrant lies of a modern-day apocalypse: world-shaking disasters, unknowable cosmic entities, and prophecies unraveling toward the End.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Unconventional Combat Styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a band of heroes whose strategies break the mold. From Clancy, the uncontrollable berserker, to Nixie, the item-hoarding kleptomaniac, each ally brings their own unique quirks, guaranteed to shake up combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transformations Galore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their powers grow, enemies and allies alike undergo astonishing transformations. Watch your party evolve in fantastic new ways throughout the adventure and prepare for surprising mid-journey mishaps and sudden shape-shifting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Entities Shaping the Apocalypse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret war rages in the cosmos. Peer behind the veil and step into the Apocalypse. Meet its victims, its instigators, and uncover the dark forces who are bringing about the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/extras/8d57252a7ab184065023c4403c5bea41.poster.avif?t=1749686452\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/extras/8d57252a7ab184065023c4403c5bea41.apng?t=1749686452\" class=\"bb_img\" width=108 height=128 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Slugware"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603430/2b8ded77bc3178c60b4dd0fd787a73dc1e6eb85c/header.jpg?t=1749686452","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603430/1674016952/cd2ac4d3788343f77b02c987b83f9bdeafa2d2ad/1750448724/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748325990","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603430/1674016952/cd2ac4d3788343f77b02c987b83f9bdeafa2d2ad/1750448724/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748325990","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603430/1674016952/cd2ac4d3788343f77b02c987b83f9bdeafa2d2ad/1750448724/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748325990","id":257130595,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130595/movie480.mp4?t=1748325990","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130595/movie_max.mp4?t=1748325990"},"name":"Intro Cinematic","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130595/14d00ef5d891ae0739ee23bd0f50a168f8a93417/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748325990","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130595/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748325990","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130595/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748325990"}}],"name":"Kid Kharagma","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 8.1/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10 compatible GPU<br><